{"chapters":[{"title":"Greedy by earliest end","frames":[{"caption":"A pair (c, d) can follow (a, b) if b &lt; c. Find the longest chain. Like activity selection: always take the pair that <strong>ends earliest</strong>, leaving the most room for the rest.","grid":{"v":[["1,2","7,8","4,5","2,3","5,6","3,9"]],"cls":[["","","","","",""]],"rowLabels":["pair"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]}},{"caption":"Sort by the second number.","grid":{"v":[["1,2","2,3","4,5","5,6","7,8","3,9"]],"cls":[["","","","","",""]],"rowLabels":["by end"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]}},{"caption":"(1, 2) starts after nothing: take it. Chain length 1.","grid":{"v":[["1,2","2,3","4,5","5,6","7,8","3,9"]],"cls":[["cur","","","","",""]],"rowLabels":["by end"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"last end = 2;  length = 1"},{"caption":"(2, 3) starts at 2, not after the current end 2: skip it.","grid":{"v":[["1,2","2,3","4,5","5,6","7,8","3,9"]],"cls":[["chosen","no","","","",""]],"rowLabels":["by end"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"last end = 2;  length = 1"},{"caption":"(4, 5) starts after the last end: take it. Chain length 2.","grid":{"v":[["1,2","2,3","4,5","5,6","7,8","3,9"]],"cls":[["chosen","","cur","","",""]],"rowLabels":["by end"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"last end = 5;  length = 2"},{"caption":"(5, 6) starts at 5, not after the current end 5: skip it.","grid":{"v":[["1,2","2,3","4,5","5,6","7,8","3,9"]],"cls":[["chosen","","chosen","no","",""]],"rowLabels":["by end"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"last end = 5;  length = 2"},{"caption":"(7, 8) starts after the last end: take it. Chain length 3.","grid":{"v":[["1,2","2,3","4,5","5,6","7,8","3,9"]],"cls":[["chosen","","chosen","","cur",""]],"rowLabels":["by end"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"last end = 8;  length = 3"},{"caption":"(3, 9) starts at 3, not after the current end 8: skip it.","grid":{"v":[["1,2","2,3","4,5","5,6","7,8","3,9"]],"cls":[["chosen","","chosen","","chosen","no"]],"rowLabels":["by end"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"last end = 8;  length = 3"},{"caption":"Longest chain: <strong>3</strong> pairs. The O(n&sup2;) LIS-style DP gives the same answer; greedy is O(n log n).","grid":{"v":[["1,2","2,3","4,5","5,6","7,8","3,9"]],"cls":[["chosen","","chosen","","chosen",""]],"rowLabels":["by end"],"colLabels":["0","1","2","3","4","5"]},"formula":"answer = 3"}]}]}